WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.510
Basically, I woke up this morning,

00:01.570 --> 00:03.110
and I realized, "Oh, my God,

00:03.730 --> 00:05.970
anything that I can do on a computer,

00:06.690 --> 00:09.050
Claude can do on a computer for me,"

00:09.850 --> 00:10.550
from

00:10.730 --> 00:13.430
setting up agents to run my home, uh,

00:13.530 --> 00:15.510
maintenance o- on an automated schedule

00:15.950 --> 00:17.170
to ordering pizza for me.

00:17.710 --> 00:18.410
Like,

00:19.430 --> 00:20.130
it’s incredible.
